---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import OfficialSources from '../../components/OfficialSources.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy policy for this debt payoff calculator 2026"
  description="Nothing you type ever leaves your browser: here is what is measured, what is not, which cookies exist, and how to exercise the rights you hold over all of it."
>
  <section class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto prose prose-lg">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-8">Last updated: October 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Overview</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        MyDebtPayoff.com is committed to protecting your privacy. This privacy policy explains how we handle
        information when you visit our website. The short version: we collect minimal data and never collect,
        store, or transmit your financial information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Financial Data</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        All debt calculations are performed entirely in your web browser using client-side JavaScript. The debt
        balances, interest rates, payment amounts, and other financial information you enter into our calculator
        are never transmitted to our servers, stored in any database, or shared with any third party. Your
        financial data remains on your device at all times.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Analytics</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">We use Plausible Analytics, a privacy-focused analytics service, to count page views, referral sources, browser type and country. Plausible does not use cookies and does not identify individual visitors.</p>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">We also use Microsoft Clarity to see how pages are used. It records clicks, scrolling, pages viewed and their address, device and browser type, and an approximate location derived from the IP address. What you type into a field, including balances, interest rates and payment amounts, is masked in your browser and is not sent. Clarity loads when the page opens: the site shows no notice and no consent banner.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">The calculator sets no cookies and we serve no advertising. Microsoft Clarity sets the cookies <code>_clck</code> (one year) and <code>_clsk</code> (one day), and Microsoft may set <code>MUID</code> and <code>CLID</code> on its own domains. To refuse them, block third-party cookies or the domain clarity.ms in your browser, and clear site data to remove cookies already set; the calculator works without them.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">The third-party services we use are Plausible Analytics and Microsoft Clarity, as described above. We do not use Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel or social media pixels. We do not serve advertisements or use advertising networks.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Data Retention</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">We do not collect or retain the financial information you enter. Plausible Analytics keeps aggregate statistics in accordance with its privacy policy. Microsoft Clarity keeps session recordings for 30 days and aggregated data for up to 13 months; Microsoft’s handling, including processing in the United States, is described in its <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">privacy statement</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Our website is not directed to children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect any information
        from children.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">Under applicable data protection laws including GDPR and CCPA, you have rights of access, deletion and objection regarding your personal data. We do not sell personal information, and the calculator itself collects none. If you have any questions or concerns about your privacy, please contact us through the website.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an
        updated revision date. Your continued use of the website after any changes constitutes your acceptance of
        the updated policy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <OfficialSources />
</Layout>
